Exercice 1 :
Compiler les modules :
 > make
Charger le premier module :
 > sudo insmod mydriver1.ko 
 > sudo dmesg -c
 vmalloc allocated at        0000000015b90711 | 0x414141413a029000
 kmalloc KERNEL allocated at 00000000af0c83ee | 0x4242424201548040
 kmalloc USER allocated at   000000005aeea90b | 0x4343434301548100
 kmalloc DMA allocated at    000000002c226bcc | 0x44444444021a2000
 kmalloc ATOMIC allocated at 00000000baa4134a | 0x4545454501548080

Ajouter 1 ou 2 nouvels espaces memoires en USER et vmalloc
Interpréter les valeurs.
